... the language defined by running it through its own five Primitives
Primitive
    - Motivation
        ... why it exists — final cause, for the sake of which
        User
            - Work out what you mean 
            - Others come to mean the same thing you mean
            Knowledge Worker
            Business Analyst
            Enterprise Architect
    - Network
        ... where it lives and is recorded — paradigmatic cause, the pattern
        GitHub
            - File
                extension: aot
                format: plain text
                indent: 4 spaces, never tabs
            ...
        Token
            Idea
                Schema (Acting On)
                    - Concept (Universal Substance)
                        ... defines a class or type of thing
                        ... children that partition the parent into subtypes are Concepts
                        ... defined grouping is a Concept; something you could touch or look up is an Example
                        ... prefer examples, attributes and defaults over creating new concepts
                        ... convert raw data into example-attribute-value relationships under a concept
                        ... most general accurate term possible
                        recognise: first letter is capitalised
                        said of: True
                        present in: False
                        example: Human
                    - Attribute (Universal Accident)
                        ... defines a property that a concept has
                        ... lowercase properties a concept has, which may have their own children
                        - Essence And Accident
                            ... attributes on a Concept are essential and inherited; attributes an Example adds are accidental
                        - Only Lowercase Characters
                        - Same Slot For Different Frames Means The Slot Has A Dependent Frame
                        - Assign Enough Concatenated Frame Properties To Be Unambigous
                        - Order Per Type From Most Intrisic To Most Extrisic
                        - No Transitive Frame Slot Dependence
                        recognise: all lowercase
                        said of: True
                        present in: True
                        example: full name
                        ... every attribute is itself a concept
                Content (Being Acted Upon)
                    ... the acted-upon individuals on which true schema stands
                    - Example (Individual Substance)
                        
                        ... lists concrete individuals of the parent concept or attribute
                        ... a selection are Examples
                        ... Most specific accrucate term possible
                        ... Natural Occuring Frame
                        ... Higher Level Is Better
                    
                        recognise: must start with dash and space
                        said of: False
                        present in: False
                        is: Content
                        predicate: Is A Example Of
                        begin
                            - Dash
                            - End of Line
                            - ` inside a concept or attribute
                        end: end of line
                        allow special value override
                            - Elipsis
                            - Boolean
                    - Default Value (Individual Accident)
                        ... sets the expected or default value for an attribute or concept
                        ... Fits On One Line
                        ... Atomic Unicode Data
                        ... may be used twice
                            ... Default of A Slot
                            ... Part Of A Frame TO Specify Applicable Content
                        start: : 
                        end: End of line
                        recognise: colon separated value
                        said of: False
                        present in: True
                        example: colour: red
                        allow special value override
                            - Boolean
                            - Ellipses
                        allow folding: Yes
                        allow special value override: No
                        predicate: Detailed By
                        
                    - Map
                        ... marks intentionally omitted or incomplete information
                        ... use a Map to mark intentionally incomplete sections
                        recognise: starts with ellipsis followed by a description
                        said of: False
                        begin: ...
                        end: End Of Line
                        is special value override: Yes
                        predicate: Explained By
            Connection
                Indented Hierarchy
                    ... Decompose further when detail adds meaningful value
                    Place a thing by its nearest kind (genus)
                    Add a qualifier that sets it apart (differentia)
                    - is-a
                        ... predication, indent a Concept under a term
                    
                        
                            
                    - has-a
                        ... inheritance, indent an attribute under a term
                    rules
                        - Parent Child
                            - May Have Many First Class Entities
                            - Indent For Child Of Parent
                            - Child Is A Parent
                            - More Than One Child
                            - No More Than Twelve Children
                            - A Child's Child Is A Parent
                            - A Child Has One Parent
                            - Two Different Types If Different Parents
                            - Inheritance
                                - Inherit Slots From Full Linage Of Parents
                                - Overload To Closest Inheritance
                        - Sibling
                            - All Siblings Have The Same Granualarity
                            - Siblings May Have The Same Slot If Default Values Are Different
                            - New Lines 
                    
                Same Line Connection
                    - value-is
                        ... colon after a term
                    - has-another-name
                        ... parentheses after a term provide an alias
                        begin: (
                        end: )
                        allow special value override: Ellispis
                        - For Dependency Or A More General Context Name
                        - Can Be Used For Both A Frame And A Slot
                        - On The Same Line As Frame Or Slot
                            - When Frame Has More Then One Of The Same Slots
                            - May Link To Frame
                Reference to a `not said of` Idea
                    - attribute-is-a-concept
                        ... attribute name or last words match a Concept name
                        type: Reference
                    - default-is-a-example
                        ... value matches an example name exactly
                        type: Reference
                    indentation: exactly 4 spaces per level
        primitives
    - Function
        ... what it is — formal cause, the form and essence
        Understand Foundation
            - Alphabet of Human Thought
                - every concept is reduced to primitive elements
                - every complex idea expressible as a combination of those elements
                - every argument is verifiable like arithmetic
            - Pragmatic
                - n idea becomes clear after the connections to other ideas are defined
                - Knowledge holds its shape best as a tree of plain text, not prose or diagrams
            - Aristotelian
                - You never think from nothing; every new thought extends structures you already know
                ...
        Iterate Over Extension
            Create New Laugange
                Install Dependency
                Create Yo Code Extenstion
                    Go To Terminal
                    Change Path To Where You Want To Save The File
                    Type `yo code` Into Terminal
                    Follow Prompt
                        what type of extension do you want to create: New Language Support
                        url or file to import, or none for new: ENTER
                        extension name: alphabet of thought
                        extension identifier: aot
                        extension description: alphabet of thought
                        language id: aot
                        langaguge name: alphabet of thought
                        file extension: .aot
                        scope name: source.aot
                        initialise git repository: Yes 
                Create `TextMate` Grammar
                    Update "oat.tmLanguage.json" file
                    Update "language-configuration.json" file
            Make Change
                Run `python install.py` Command
                    Update Package Version
                        Update Version Number 
                            file: package.json
                            attribute: "version"
                        Run `npx @vscode/vsce package` Command
                    Update Local Extension
                        Run `code --install-extension .\alphabet-of-thought-1.1.2.vsix --force` Command
                        Reload VS Code (Ctrl+Shift+P → "Developer: Reload Window") for the new version to take effect
                    Update Remote Extension
                Make Changes To Marketplace
                    Go To `https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/manage/publishers/Jakus` Link
                    Click `...` `More Actions` Button
                    Click `Update` DropDown
                    Drag `*.vsix` File Into `Visual Studio Code` Window
                    Click `Install` Button
                    Click `Reload` Button
                Upload Changes To GitHub
        Publish File
            Create File
                file extension: aot
                    ... never use tabs
                - plain text, not prose
                - a tree, not a diagram
                - use full words, never abbreviate
                - fix all misspellings
            Setup Primitives
                - Motivation
                - Network
                - Function
                - Timeline
                - Workflow
            Code Tokens
                - Ideas
                - Connections
                    Inheritance
                        ... child concepts and examples inherit all parent essential attributes, never examples
                    Polymorphism
                        ... child concepts may add essential attributes; examples may add only accidental ones
                    One term, one definition
            Share File
                
    ... To-Do
    
    - Workflow
        ... what it is built out of and when clarity arrives — material cause
        
        Work Out What You Mean: Asynchronous
            - Create File
                interval: 
                timeout: when file is published
            - Iterate Over Extension
                worker pool: 1

